WEBVTT

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:27.650
Print or export a page: PDF, Word, a web page, Markdown or plain text - pictures, shapes and icons included.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:43.010
Dark theme and Dim for long evenings; Stay on top while you copy between apps.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:51.820
World clocks in the header - for the teams in other time zones.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:01:04.050
The session clipboard remembers what you copied while EasyNotes runs - local, temporary, opt-in.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:18.900
Settings: storage, backups, clipboard, appearance, Windows integration and MCP - everything from the setup, changeable later.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:24.567
Scheduled, verified backups protect it all - restorable from Settings.

